[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6088185209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108326#issuecomment-6088185209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108326","id":6088185209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABauJVeQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T19:53:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T19:53:13Z","body":"Can you make a bug report with a repro for this? That way we can test and confirm the behaviour you are describing","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6088185209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6101059876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108326#issuecomment-6101059876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108326","id":6101059876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa6bJJA","user":{"login":"dillona","id":135138,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTEzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona","html_url":"https://github.com/dillona","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dillona/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T18:58:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T18:58:29Z","body":"Thanks for taking a look! To be upfront: I don't think this produces any user-visible bug, so I can't give a repro that shows broken behavior.\n\nThe old expression is `buf + alignment - (buf % alignment)`. When `buf` is already 64-byte aligned, that comes out to `buf + 64` instead of `buf`. Because `resize()` allocates `alignment` extra bytes, the tile array still fits inside the allocation, so there's no overflow or misalignment. The only effect is 64 wasted bytes, and only when the allocator happens to return an aligned pointer.\n\nMinimal illustration of the arithmetic:\n\n```cpp\nuintptr_t p = 0x1000; // already 64-aligned\nuintptr_t old_off = 64 - (p % 64);          // 64\nuintptr_t new_off = (64 - (p % 64)) % 64;   // 0\n```\n\nSo this is really a small correctness/cleanup fix rather than a bug fix. I'm happy to retitle it that way, or to close it if you'd rather not take a no-op change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6101059876/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]